Verse 3
[Gm]As true [Cm]as [Bb]God's [F]own [Dm]word [Gm]is [D]true, [Gm]Not [Eb]earth [D]nor [Bb]hell
with [F]all [Gm]their [D]crew [Dm]A[Cm]gainst [Bb]us [F]shall [Bb]prevail.
